==== hyperbricks yaml {!{card}} ====
card:
  - type: template
  - template:
      file: cards/card.html
  - values:
      title: Template values fixture
      lead: Plain scalar values remain map fields.
      cards:
        - title: First card
          body: First card is data, not a child component.
          variant: primary
        - title: Second card
          body: Second card stays in array order.
          variant: flat
      cta:
        - type: html
        - value: |
            <a href="/start" class="btn">Start</a>
==== explainer ====
Template values can contain scalar fields, arrays of plain data maps, and nested
component values without numeric child keys.
==== expected materialized json ====
{
  "@type": "<TEMPLATE>",
  "template": "cards/card.html",
  "values": {
    "cards": [
      {
        "body": "First card is data, not a child component.",
        "title": "First card",
        "variant": "primary"
      },
      {
        "body": "Second card stays in array order.",
        "title": "Second card",
        "variant": "flat"
      }
    ],
    "cta": {
      "@type": "<HTML>",
      "value": "<a href=\"/start\" class=\"btn\">Start</a>\n"
    },
    "lead": "Plain scalar values remain map fields.",
    "title": "Template values fixture"
  }
}
